{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSTabBarV","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","beta":false}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSTabBar","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is a SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"code":"TabView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" which applies OUDS tokens and styles on its content supposing to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"views with ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"tab bar items","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tab bar is, for iOS, a bottom bar with tabs containing for example images, texts and badges. It can vary for iPadOS.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(content:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(selected:count:content:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Appearances","level":2,"text":"Appearances","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 26 brings Liquid Glass, the new Apple look and feel which will prevent developers to define specific styles for some critical components like bars."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because today the OUDS tab bar relies on native component and is not designed from scratch, some elements will look different between iOS 26 and older versions:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"background color of tab bar can be changed for iOS lower than 26","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"background color of tab bar does not change since iOS 26","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"normal \/ unselected tab item color can be changed for both image and text only for iOS lower than 26","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"with iOS 26 no token of color are applied on unselected \/ normal tab item because only the image will be changed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and not the text making theme not readable in dark color scheme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition the badges colors will be the same and cannot be changed (except with token definition). These particular badges do not rely on "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadge","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" component,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the native API is used instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because Liquid Glass is available since iOS 26, the tab bar will be liquified \/ glassified since this OS version, not before."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you use SF Symbols for images, if they exist their "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"fill","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" variant will be automatically used in the tab bar (native behaviour)."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Platform considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Platform-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This component is tailored for iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On iPadOS the tabs do not apply the fonts since iPadOS 18","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because macOS does not support UIKit and because UIKIt is used to define the style of the tab bar, there is not styling of the tab bar for macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"visionOS with is specific UI does not apply colors on tab bars and things are glasssified","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for watchOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for tvOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Guidelines","type":"heading","anchor":"Guidelines"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS guidelines recommends to:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"limit when possible the number of items to 5","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"use both images and texts in tab bar items","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"use badges only when needed to avoid to have heavy tab bar","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"be sure the selected information is not only defined by the color of the tab; you may need to change the shape or the fill of the image","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"if a badge must be displayed, prefer short texts. If the text is a decimal value greater than 99, prefer display “+99”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"if decorative images are used for tab bar item, apply ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"template","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rendering mode on it to apply color on tabs","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Technical constraints","type":"heading","anchor":"Technical-constraints"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You must use in your tab bar items images with ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a size of 26 x 26","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", otherwise rendering could be unaligned with Figma specifications","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the component cannot compute the ideal width of the selected tab indicator (for iOS before 26 and iPadOS before 18), ideal width based on the tab bar item content,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this indicator is not displayed for iOS lower than 26 in landscape mode and iPadOS.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If your tabs embeded in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" do not contain texts but only images, add an accessibility label introducing the journey for this tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If your tabs embeded in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" display a badge (empty or with text), vocalize it in your tab to let users know what it is (unread messages, new things, etc)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by using accessibiltiy value","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    OUDSTabBar {","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Emails\") \/\/ The text is vocalized first","                        .accessibilityValue(\"5 unread emails\") \/\/ A value vocalized after the text","            } icon: {","                Image(systemName: \"mail\").accessibilityHidden(true)","            }","        }","        .badge(5) \/\/ The value you give to the badge","    }",""]},{"level":2,"text":"Selection of tabs","type":"heading","anchor":"Selection-of-tabs"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS lower than 26, a selected tab indicator can be displayed in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"count"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is defined (to the number of tabs in the component)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"selected"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is equal to a given tag associated to a tab item."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise the indicator won’t appear; these parameters are mandatory to compute the location of the indicator."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This rule is only applied if selected tab indicator must be displayed."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Technical considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Technical-considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to improve the Developer eXperience the current "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation lets users define their own tab items."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OUDS applies only appearances and styles on elements to prevent users to define raw data to assign to the component before being rendered like a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"picker","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus users will need to add their own accessiiblity label if badges are used or also apply "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"template","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering mode on images if needed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus it will be also possible to use Liquid Glass new API with animations and items stacking."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Use the OUDS tab bar to wrap tab bar items and associated views","    \/\/ Item tagged 0 will be selected first, 3 tabs are embeded.","    \/\/ Image with size of 26 x 26","    OUDSTabBar(selected: 0, count: 3) {","","        \/\/ Add the views with the SwiftUI tab item and labels","        \/\/ No need to define colors, everything is done inside OUDSTabBar","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 1\", image: \"image_1\")","            }","            .tag(0) \/\/ Must match the selected parameter","        OtherView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Label 2\")","                } icon: {","                    Image(decorative: \"image_2\")","                        .renderingMode(.template) \/\/ Mandatory to apply color on selected item","                }","            .tag(1) \/\/ Must be used for the selected parameter","        LastView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 3\", image: \"image_3\")","            }","            .tag(2) \/\/ Must be used for the selected parameter","    }"]},{"level":2,"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","type":"reference"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"level":3,"text":"Liquid Glass","type":"heading","anchor":"Liquid-Glass"},{"level":4,"text":"Orange","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark","type":"image"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Orange Business Tools","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Business-Tools"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeBusinessTools_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeBusinessTools_dark","type":"image"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Sosh","type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark","type":"image"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark","type":"image"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Without Liquid Glass","type":"heading","anchor":"Without-Liquid-Glass"},{"level":4,"text":"Orange","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark","type":"image"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Orange Business Tools","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Business-Tools"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeBusinessTools_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeBusinessTools_dark","type":"image"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Sosh","type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark","type":"image"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark","type":"image"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Version","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inl